One useful thing from our breathing research roundup: you don't need the fanciest technique. Slow breathing around 6 breaths a minute has the strongest support. 4-6 gets you there: in for 4, out for 6, 10 seconds a breath.

Wound up mid-scroll? Do two gentle physiological sighs first, then a few 4-6 breaths.
